<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S9" title="In From Logs to Language: Learning Optimal Verbalization for LLM-Based Recommendation in Production" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">9 </span>Conclusion</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px1" title="In Ethics Statement ‣ From Logs to Language: Learning Optimal Verbalization for LLM-Based Recommendation in Production" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Data Privacy.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#Sx1.SS0.SSS0.Px2" title="In Ethics Statement ‣ From Logs to Language: Learning Optimal Verbalization for LLM-Based Recommendation in Production" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Intended Use.</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_bibliography"><a href="#bib" title="In From Logs to Language: Learning Optimal Verbalization for LLM-Based Recommendation in Production" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">References</span></a></li>
</ol></nav>
